"overview\":\"The team receives a distress call from the lion riders of planet Ariel, where Wade's been drilling for an ore in the planet's core. While there, Vince's strange abilities open up an ancient door.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/112094/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-14\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Flash Form Go!\",\"overview\":\"A strange robotic eye is tearing up Arus, and attacks too fast to allow Voltron to form!\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/112095/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-21\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Dark Blue\",\"overview\":\"A Drule freighter full of Haggarium crashes into the bottomless ocean of planet Poseidous... with Vince inside!\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/112096/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-28\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Wanted and Unwanted\",\"overview\":\"Daniel and Keith are arrested and sent to \\\"The Void,\\\" Wade's secret prison.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/112097/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-04\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Predator Robeast\",\"overview\":\"Maahox's new robeasts prevent the Voltron Lions from leaving their dens.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/112098/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-11\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Hungry for Voltron\",\"overview\":\"Allura takes a diplomatic trip to Ebb, a planet under Garrison blockade.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/112099/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-18\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Clash of the Lions\",\"overview\":\"Wade takes control of Voltron!\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/1121